<<if _hsMidOpen>><<socialiseicon>><<link [[当铺暗柜掌眼 (0:12)|MP Loc HighStreet Event 4]]>><<pass 12>><</link>><br><<else>><span class="disabled">当铺暗柜掌眼（开放窗 10:00–22:00 且无整顿期）</span><br><</if>>
<<if _hsMidOpen>><<shopicon>><<link [[茶座旁听 (0:20)|MP Loc HighStreet Tea Lane]]>><</link>><br><</if>>
